B.a0h=new A.bf(B.jk,['How does Blupp calculate my "Safe-to-Spend" balance?',"Safe-to-Spend dynamically scans your total liquid cash across all bank accounts and subtracts your pending bills, committed monthly envelope budgets, and reserve buffer. This ensures you never accidentally spend rent or savings money on discretionary purchases."],t.li)
B.a0g=new A.bf(B.jk,["Is my financial and banking data secure?","Yes. Blupp uses client-side encryption and row-level security (RLS) powered by Supabase. Your raw bank credentials are never stored. iOS automation runs completely locally on your device via Apple Shortcuts."],t.li)
B.a0j=new A.bf(B.jk,["How does the Apple Shortcuts auto-sync work?","Whenever you close a supported bank app (MAE, CIMB, TNG eWallet), an iOS Automation triggers a deep link that opens Blupp with your latest transaction ready for 1-tap categorization."],t.li)
B.a0i=new A.bf(B.jk,["Can I export my data or print financial reports?","Yes! You can export your full transaction ledger as standard CSV format or print your monthly cash flow reports directly using browser print or PDF export from the Analytics screen."],t.li)
